# docker build context whitelist. Without this, `docker build` ships the
# entire repo to the daemon as build context - data/ alone is ~74 GB of
# model weights. See documents/plans/agent_server_admin_ux.md.
#   - app/      : the agent_server image (Dockerfile / Dockerfile.fat)
#   - adapter/  : the llama.cpp adapter image (Dockerfile.llama-adapter) -
#                 a few tiny files (generator + entrypoint).
*
!app
!adapter
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
